caption: Training Traits
domain-rule: training-traits

Once the character has legitimate access, Training Traits may be self-taught; instructor requirements that arise only from study rules or Trained by a Master are ignored. Trained by a Master is always a Kung Fu Training Trait and may be learned entirely through self-practice at normal point cost.

The following are Training Traits once legally available:

Every skill and technique in the character's complete Mundane Martial Art, including optional and cinematic entries.

Traits explicitly granted, required, or listed as governing traits by higher Kung Fu Traditions.

Any trait the character may currently purchase with at least one of that Oathbound instance's three Shido as a Required Disadvantage/Pact.

Adventuring can generate training only when it materially exercises the Training Trait or directly develops it. Apply the GM's ordinary adventuring-to-learning conversion, then the normal ×4 acceleration. Accelerated Training is personal; it does not accelerate students unless another ability says so.
